 actualSourceAfterValue t factory packet bornCurrent occurrence=
 sourceRawSlots (sourceRawFeet (actualInitQuarterSource t factory packet) 1) := by
 rw [actual_whole_source_raw_successor,actual_source_before_is_generated_initial,source_slots_actual_next]
